<title>UK: CS First Boston hires retail analyst Shriver.</title>
<headline>CS First Boston hires retail analyst Shriver.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston, the investment banking arm of CS Holding, said on Tuesday it had hired David Shriver as a retail analyst in London.</p>
<p>Shriver, 32, was head of European research at NatWest Securities until June 1996.</p>
<p>His appointment as a director is part of CS First Boston's plans to expand its London based pan European equity research team, the firm said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
